-- 5. Outro — dissolve to bass fragments and sparse texture, then silence

-- remove layers gradually
xfadeIn 4 16 $ silence

xfadeIn 7 8 $ silence

xfadeIn 9 8 $ silence

d2 $ silence

d3 $ silence

d6 $ silence

d10 $ silence

-- bass fragments over sparse texture
d8 $ degradeBy 0.45 $ bassMain # lpf 240 # gain 0.84

d5 $ degradeBy 0.3 $ spaceTex # gain 0.58

-- final: bass only, then hush
-- d5 $ silence
-- xfadeIn 8 16 $ silence
-- hush
